#. あの<CLT 3>ガラス玉<CLT>は、
#. 葉隠クンがランドリーに忘れた物らしいけど…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"It would appear that Hiro simply forgot his <CLT 3>crystal\n"
"ball<CLT> in the laundry room."
msgstr ""

#. 桑田クンは、シャツの血を洗い流そうと向かった
#. ランドリーで、それを見つけたんじゃないの？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"You went there to try and wash the blood out of your\n"
"shirt, and that's where you saw it, right?"
msgstr ""

#. そして、その時、
#. 今の方法を思いついた…
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Seeing the ball, you thought of a way to take care of\n"
"everything..."
msgstr ""

#. どうなの桑田君？　何か反論はある？
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So, Leon...do you object to anything that's been said?"
msgstr ""

#. 反論が…あるかって…？
msgctxt "0005 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid "Do I object...?"
msgstr ""

#. あるよ、あるあるっ！！
#. あるに決まってんだろぉぉがぁぁッ！！
msgctxt "0006 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Hell yes I object! Of course I do! I object, I object,\n"
"I object!"
msgstr ""

#. つーか、今のって全部推論だろ？
#. 証拠がねーじゃねーか、証拠がよッ！！
msgctxt "0007 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"I mean, all of this is just a bunch of stupid\n"
"theories! You need evidence! Where's the evidence!?"
msgstr ""

#. 証拠がなけりゃ、ただのデッチ上げだ！
#. そんなモン認めねーぞ！！
msgctxt "0008 | LEON KUWATA"
msgid ""
"Without evidence, it's all bullshit! It's bullshit and\n"
"I refuse to acknowledge it!"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木君、だったら教えてあげるといいわ。
#. 彼が犯人だという証拠をね…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Well then, I guess this is as good a time as any to\n"
"present the evidence that proves you did it."
msgstr ""

#. あなたは…その証拠を持っているはずよ…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Makoto...I believe you're in possession of that\n"
"evidence?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが…<CLT><CLT 3>証拠<CLT><CLT 4>を持っている…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I...have the <CLT><CLT 3>evidence<CLT><CLT 4>?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
